{"id":"n71672-2-7","stage":4,"title":"의리 · 义气","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71672-2-7-1","ko":"우리는 이제 의리를 맺은 사이일세.","zh":"我们现在是结义兄弟了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리는","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리는","audio":"/audio/6cae49a92f8e0e0e2ffd.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"의리를","meaning":"义气","explanation":"의리：义气；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의리","audio":"/audio/96f6883b952e23a775ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71672","senseId":"2","lemma":"의리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의리를","audio":"/audio/bd3212bae9866b509564.mp3"}},{"text":"맺은","meaning":"缔结","explanation":"맺다：缔结；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맺다","audio":"/audio/623e599b6dea2061ff2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15976","senseId":"5","lemma":"맺다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맺은","audio":"/audio/62c0e81e08c53892dbe1.mp3"}},{"text":"사이일세.","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄹ세：向平辈或晚辈说明想法或感叹新发现的事实。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이일세","audio":"/audio/9f6e1dac4015a2abff2e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"96f6883b952e23a7","term":"의리","zh":"义气","audio":"/audio/96f6883b952e23a775ce.mp3","entryId":"71672","definition":"和没有血缘关系的人结成的亲密关系。","pronunciation":["의ː리"]},{"id":"623e599b6dea2061","term":"맺다","zh":"缔结","audio":"/audio/623e599b6dea2061ff2f.mp3","entryId":"15976","definition":"人与人之间建立人际关系。","pronunciation":["맫따"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3bfcdec7f210c9e1f15.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71672-2-7-2","ko":"네. 평생 형님으로 모시겠습니다.","zh":"是，我会一辈子把您当大哥敬重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"평생","meaning":"平生，一生，终生，终身，一辈子","explanation":"평생：平生，一生，终生，终身，一辈子。","readings":[{"term":"평생","audio":"/audio/c783b4a7c2941675b2be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71485","senseId":"1","lemma":"평생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평생","audio":"/audio/c783b4a7c2941675b2be.mp3"}},{"text":"형님으로","meaning":"大哥，兄长","explanation":"형님：大哥，兄长；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"형님","audio":"/audio/e5b5f365fc316d663aaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85711","senseId":"1","lemma":"형님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형님으로","audio":"/audio/0707182920f426327367.mp3"}},{"text":"모시겠습니다.","meaning":"认作，奉为，推举，拜","explanation":"모시다：认作，奉为，推举，拜；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모시다","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64703","senseId":"4","lemma":"모시다","origin":"NIKL Kore